<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεισ-πίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rush in along with</i> or <i>together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν θάλατταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.7.25
				</span></i>
			; esp. of soldiers pursuing the besieged to their own gates
			and getting in with them, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φεύγουσι ἐς τὸ τεῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.55
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.102
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.7
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ σοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					1095
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἴσω τῶν πυλῶν σὺν τῷ ὄχλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.1.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰς πύλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.7.6
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				3.15
			</span></i>; of fevers, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				4.22
			</span></i>.</div>
